Update Mechanism: Static (https://crbug.com/503546519)
License: LGPL-2.1
License File: LICENSE
Shipped: no
Security Critical: no

Description:
This is libgudev, a library providing GObject bindings for libudev. It
used to be part of udev, then merged into systemd. It's now a project
on its own.

This is only used in tests.

This is marked Static because upstream is effectively dormant: 238 (July
2023) is the latest release, and the only upstream commits since then are
metadata and build-system tweaks. If upstream makes a new release, update
using the steps below.

Local Modifications:
None.

When updating to a new version, update the Revision above with the new commit hash,
and perform the following steps:
1. Run on_update.sh
2. Check in the generated files along with the changes for the update.
